  "description": "With his sharply defined, handsome features, an effortlessly composed air that carries a hint of cold warmth, and a flawless physique, alpha male **Cha Junseo** is a transfer student known as someone born to be treated like royalty.\nJust as beauty naturally draws the eye, whenever Junseo appears on campus, the people around him can't help but make a fuss.\nThe openly gay **Baek Doa** is no exception. After all, he found himself completely captivated by Junseo's incredible physique the moment he saw him.\nThen their eyes meet.\nJunseo gives Doa a seductive look, and Doa's heart races at this unexpected stroke of luck...\nCompared to the other men who treat him like nothing more than a prostitute, Junseo is on a completely different level. With his looks, status, and everything else he has to offer, Doa can barely think straight. To top it all off, this perfect alpha male is seducing him and whispering that he's interested in him.\nThe moment Doa finally gets his hands on the irresistible Junseo, however, he finds himself faced with a disturbing metal cage and photographs from his own past.\n\"Do you like it? I prepared it just for you.\"\n\"You're beautiful, Doa... Even more beautiful than I imagined.\"\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
